  "browserScenarioExecuted": false,
  "conclusion": "Both trading.unknown and trading.duplicate link placeOrder, modifyOrder, cancelOrder, listOpenOrders and listOrderHistory. All three mutations require Idempotency-Key. The order lists have no key or clientOrderId filter; there is no direct GET by orderId. clientOrderId is optional on request and response with no uniqueness/echo guarantee. placeOrder 409 conflates duplicate key and insufficient balance; modify/cancel have no documented stable same-key replay result. Keep both scenarios not_verified; do not retry or simulate order mutations after unknown outcomes.",
